      <h1 class="blog-title">Burst Pipe Emergency in Liverpool: The First 5 Minutes Matter Most</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">A burst pipe can soak your home fast. What you do in the first few minutes decides how much damage you get. Read this now, before it happens.</p>
      <div class="blog-meta">
        <span><strong>By</strong> Liverpool Emergency Plumber</span>
